# The handoff system stays on this machine and out of the published repository.
# Code and product files push as normal; the agent scaffolding does not.
AGENTS.md
current-state.md
project-purpose.md
improvement-plan.md
project-context/
.claude/

# These files then travel by file sync, meaning iCloud Drive, Dropbox or whatever
# keeps this folder on your other machines. Two consequences follow, and both are
# real. A collaborator who clones from the remote receives none of it, so they start
# by running setup themselves. And an agent on another machine sees the current
# state only once sync has finished, so check that before you ask one to continue.

# Team mode. Uncomment the four state files below to commit them instead, so that
# teammates and other machines receive the queue and the current state through the
# repository. Note that current-state.md carries the plain-language explanation of the
# last finished item, so sharing it shares that too.
# !AGENTS.md
# !current-state.md
# !project-purpose.md
# !improvement-plan.md

.DS_Store

# Python caches and local test output
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/out/

dist/
